    {
      "id": 1,
      "primary_message": "In a medium bowl, whisk together vinegar, shallot, garlic, salt, and pepper. Let mixture sit for 10 minutes. Whisk in Dijon and honey, then gradually whisk in oil in a steady stream to form an emulsified vinaigrette. Use immediately or refrigerate in an airtight container until ready to use, whisking or shaking vigorously if the vinaigrette has separated.",
